      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### 🔵 Needs a closer look\n\nThe correctness-sensitive fence update affects MI325X/gfx942 recipes, while upstream validation explicitly did not run on that hardware.\n\n**0 open findings**\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nUpdates CI to a Primus-Turbo revision containing the repaired DeepEP cheap fence, then removes the obsolete override from affected MoE recipes.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Pins Primus-Turbo to `e2d9f1d7`, including Turbo #539 and #538.\n- Removes `PRIMUS_TURBO_DEEPEP_DISABLE_CHEAP_FENCE` from 13 MI325X/MI355X recipes.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `.github/​workflows/​ci.yaml` | Updates the Primus-Turbo CI pin and feature comments. |\r\n| `examples/​megatron/​configs/​MI355X/​qwen3_30B_A3B-FP8-pretrain.yaml` | Uses the repaired default fence. |\r\n| `examples/​megatron/​configs/​MI355X/​qwen3_30B_A3B-BF16-pretrain.yaml` | Uses the repaired default fence. |\r\n| `examples/​megatron/​configs/​MI355X/​mixtral_8x7B_v0.1-FP8-pretrain.yaml` | Removes the no-op fence override. |\r\n| `examples/​megatron/​configs/​MI355X/​mixtral_8x7B_v0.1-BF16-pretrain.yaml` | Uses the repaired default fence. |\r\n| `examples/​megatron/​configs/​MI355X/​mixtral_8x22B_v0.1-FP8-pretrain.yaml` | Removes the no-op fence override. |\r\n| `examples/​megatron/​configs/​MI355X/​mixtral_8x22B_v0.1-BF16-pretrain.yaml` | Removes the no-op fence override. |\r\n| `examples/​megatron/​configs/​MI355X/​deepseek_v2_lite-FP8-pretrain.yaml` | Uses the repaired default fence. |\r\n| `examples/​megatron/​configs/​MI355X/​deepseek_v2_lite-BF16-pretrain.yaml` | Uses the repaired default fence. |\r\n| `examples/​megatron/​configs/​MI325X/​qwen3_30B_A3B-FP8-pretrain.yaml` | Uses the repaired default fence. |\r\n| `examples/​megatron/​configs/​MI325X/​qwen3_30B_A3B-BF16-pretrain.yaml` | Uses the repaired default fence. |\r\n| `examples/​megatron/​configs/​MI325X/​mixtral_8x7B_v0.1-FP8-pretrain.yaml` | Removes the no-op fence override. |\r\n| `examples/​megatron/​configs/​MI325X/​mixtral_8x7B_v0.1-BF16-pretrain.yaml` | Uses the repaired default fence. |\r\n| `examples/​megatron/​configs/​MI325X/​deepseek_v2_lite-BF16-pretrain.yaml` | Uses the repaired default fence. |\n</details>\n\n🧠 **Review effort:** Balanced\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/AMD-AGI/Primus/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>",
